<view class="page"><view class="title">项目与套餐</view><view class="rule">一个套餐只含同一项目次数。专属价仅对单个套餐设置，不全店折扣、不叠加。新设置不改变已售卡快照。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在加载配置…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="retry">重试</button></view><view class="heading section">当前项目</view><view wx:for="{{services}}" wx:key="id" class="card row"><view>{{item.name}} · {{item.duration}} 分钟<view class="small muted">{{item.active?'可预约':'已暂停'}}</view></view><button class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="editService">编辑</button></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">新增 / 编辑项目</view><input class="field" data-field="serviceId" value="{{serviceId}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="项目编号，如 facial（英文、数字）"/><input class="field" data-field="serviceName" value="{{serviceName}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="项目名称"/><view class="label">时长（15–240 分钟）</view><input class="field" type="number" data-field="duration" value="{{duration}}" bindinput="input"/><input class="field" type="digit" data-field="listPrice" value="{{listPrice}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="合理单次原价（元）"/><view class="row"><view>可预约</view><switch checked="{{serviceActive}}" data-field="serviceActive" bindchange="toggle"/></view><button bindtap="saveService" disabled="{{busy||!ready}}">保存项目</button></view><view class="heading section">当前套餐</view><view wx:for="{{packages}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="heading">{{item.name}}</view><view>{{item.total}} 次 · 默认 ¥{{item.defaultPriceText}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.tier_price_cents?'已单独设置专属价':'未设置专属价，使用默认价'}}</view><button class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="editPackage">编辑未来售价与次数</button></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">新增 / 编辑套餐</view><input class="field" data-field="packageId" value="{{packageId}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="套餐编号，如 facial5"/><input class="field" data-field="packageName" value="{{packageName}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="套餐名称"/><picker range="{{services}}" range-key="name" value="{{serviceIndex}}" bindchange="selectService">项目：{{services[serviceIndex].name}}</picker><view class="label">同项目次数（1–100）</view><input class="field" type="number" data-field="total" value="{{total}}" bindinput="input"/><input class="field" type="digit" data-field="price" value="{{price}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="默认售价（元）"/><input class="field" type="digit" data-field="vipPrice" value="{{vipPrice}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="该套餐专属等级价，留空即无优惠"/><view class="row"><view>在售</view><switch checked="{{packageActive}}" data-field="packageActive" bindchange="toggle"/></view><button bindtap="savePackage" disabled="{{busy||!ready}}">保存套餐 · 历史权益保留</button></view></view>
